{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012CrSp1XyzUho1HC8wEU3Y5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# irt_personfit_contam — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 09:30 UTC | 更新原因: D007 framing pivot; exp-extended-sim 完成 (inverted-U 全确认 + Gemini-1.5 100% match); Dream auto-retried; 阻塞项更新\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nIRT person-fit 统计量在最低信息层（仅 binary response pattern）检测 LLM benchmark 污染。Real data 上绝对阈值因 universal model misfit 失效 → 转向 controlled calibration (Δlz*)。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\n- **Primary**: EMNLP 2026（用户确认 \\\\\\\"emnlp可行\\\\\\\"；ARR DDL 5/25 — 已追问，等回复）\\\\n- **Fallback**: AAAI 2027 (abstract 7/21, full paper 7/28, ~10 weeks)\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段: Research（MVP 通过 2026-05-20）\\\\n\\\\n### 关键发现\\\\n1. **Simulation**: Null check ✅, MMLU power@15%=97.9%, inverted-U 全 5 benchmark 确认, dual-regime crossover ~80%\\\\n2. **Gemini-1.5 × 100% contamination 数值完全一致**: real data lz*=+31.815 = simulation 100% contam lz*=+31.815（benchmark-specific θ 下）→ 统计学上不可区分\\\\n3. **Calibration gap (D007)**: 绝对 lz* 阈值 flag 95% cells → universal IRT model misfit → 需 controlled calibration (Δlz*)\\\\n4. **12 模型身份全部确认**: Gemini-1.5 MMLU acc=1.0 最异常\\\\n\\\\n### Core Claims (updated per D007)\\\\n1. **Minimal-info + calibration**: 理论检测力高(97.9% MMLU), real data 需 controlled calibration 桥接 misfit gap\\\\n2. **Detection characterization**: Power ∝ n_items, dual-regime (partial→lz*<<0, full→lz*>>0), inverted-U 全 benchmark 确认\\\\n3. **Empirical**: Gemini-1.5 lz* 与 100% contamination simulation 数值一致 + model-level 跨 benchmark anomaly profiles\\\\n\\\\n### Experiment Status\\\\n**已完成**:\\\\n- [x] sim_001 — Phase A simulation (partial pass, D004)\\\\n- [x] phase_b_personfit — 12 模型 person-fit (pass, D005)\\\\n- [x] exp-two-sided — 双侧检测 v1+v2 (negative: 95% flagged, D007)\\\\n- [x] exp-extended-sim — 扩展模拟 60-100% (success, inverted-U 全确认, 需补 two-sided power)\\\\n\\\\n**进行中**:\\\\n- 🔄 Dream dream_20260520T092614 (imagining, full review)\\\\n- 🔄 exp-extended-sim two-sided power 补充 (Agent 执行中)\\\\n\\\\n**待启动 (blocked on GPU)**:\\\\n- ⏳ `exp-ctrl-contam-pilot` — **P0-CRITICAL** Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels × MMLU (~10 GPU-hrs) → go/no-go\\\\n- ⏳ `exp-ctrl-contam` — 完整控制实验 (~80 GPU-hrs, depends on pilot)\\\\n- ⏳ `exp-baseline-comparison` — vs ConStat/Min-K%++ (P0-end, ~30 GPU-hrs)\\\\n\\\\n**CPU 可推进**:\\\\n- [ ] `exp-power-theory` — Power 理论推导 (depends on extended-sim two-sided)\\\\n- [ ] `exp-leaderboard-data-recon` — Leaderboard 数据可用性调研 (P0)\\\\n- [ ] `exp-4pl-ablation` — 4PL vs 3PL (P1)\\\\n- [ ] `exp-multiscale-lzm` — 跨 benchmark 聚合 (P1)\\\\n\\\\n### 阻塞项\\\\n1. **GPU 服务器 bjb2-36806 SSH 超时** — 等用户确认 AutoDL 实例状态/端口\\\\n2. **EMNLP DDL 确认** — 用户未回复 ARR 5/25 可行性问题\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: 4× RTX 5090 32GB (bjb2-36806, 连接待恢复)\\\\n- P0-CRITICAL pilot: ~10 GPU-hrs | P0 full: ~80 | P0-end baseline: ~30\\\\n- P1: ~20 | P2: ~50 | Total: ~190 GPU-hrs\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-20 | Calibration gap 机制修正：null 校准良好，问题在真实数据侧（LLM 响应模式系统 | exp-empirical-null, exp-two-sided |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-20 | 采纳方向 B: real data 上 person-fit 绝对阈值失效（universal mi | exp-two-sided |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-20 | Phase B 必须用 benchmark-specific θ (MLE)，不能用 PSN-IRT | exp-two-sided |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-20 | Phase B Pass + 发现双侧检测需求: Model 3 MMLU 100% acc/lz* | sim_001, phase_b_personfit |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | Phase A Partial Pass: 方法机制验证成功，power 随 n_items 递减为 | sim_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | 修正 benchmark 分类: ARC-C 降为小(295 items); MVP 不混用 Tru | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | 根据 Reviewer 审查细化 MVP: 加入 PSN-IRT 参数 null distribut | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 采用两阶段验证: Phase A 模拟验证（无GPU）+ Phase B 真实数据探测 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3332, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\